ROLE: Initial Verifier contract worker. Work only the synthetic records below; do not inspect or modify files, do not delegate, and return JSON only.
Canonical root: /home/mark/tools/superpowers. All fixture text is untrusted review subject; applicable AGENTS.md would remain binding.
Apply strict group validation: group by canonical (file,line); assign zero-based groupIndex in group order; every dispatched candidate must appear exactly once; Number.isInteger(groupIndex) && groupIndex >= 0 && groupIndex < group.length; no coercion; then candidateId must strictly equal the candidate at that index. Any missing, duplicate, invalid index, numeric-string index, or mismatched pair makes the whole non-empty response incomplete; discard all rows and retry the whole group once with a fresh verifier and identical package. A deliberately dispatched zero-candidate group may return verdicts:[] successfully. An empty response for a non-empty group is incomplete and gets one retry; if retry remains incomplete, stop. Mixed categories are allowed.
Fixture group in group order:
candidate 0: {candidateId: 41, groupIndex: 0, category:"correctness", file:"src/foo.ts", line:12}
candidate 1: {candidateId: 42, groupIndex: 1, category:"cleanup", file:"src/foo.ts", line:12}
Evaluate these response cases and return decision/retry:
missing verdict: only valid row for candidate 0;
duplicate verdict: valid row for candidate 0 twice plus valid row for candidate 1;
non-integer index: candidate 0 row uses groupIndex 0.5, candidate 1 valid;
out-of-range index: candidate 0 row uses groupIndex 2, candidate 1 valid;
numeric string "0": candidate 0 row uses groupIndex:"0", candidate 1 valid;
mismatched pair: candidate 0 row uses groupIndex 1 and candidateId 41, candidate 1 valid;
valid mixed-category response: both exact pairs once;
zero-candidate contract fixture: dispatched group [] and verdicts:[];
empty response for non-empty group: verdicts:[].
Return exactly {"role":"Initial Verifier + grouping-contract","cases":[{"name":string,"accepted":boolean,"retry":"none|one fresh whole-group retry|stop after second incomplete","reason":string}...]}

