ROLE: Fallback, empty-state, and disclosure contract worker. Synthetic fixtures only; no repository inspection, no edits, no delegation, JSON only.
Canonical root: /home/mark/tools/superpowers. Apply exact rules: resolved empty requested diff is a successful empty review; zero Finder or Sweep candidates are accepted empty results; verdicts:[] is valid only for a deliberately dispatched zero-candidate Verifier fixture, but empty verdicts for a non-empty group are incomplete, discarded, retried once with a fresh whole-group Verifier, and stop after a second incomplete response; if no candidate survives independent verification report exactly "No findings survived independent verification." Synthesis is optional and never retried; on failure or no usable decisions use labeled deterministic fallback. Fallback exact-deduplicates normalized (trim fields and collapse internal whitespace) tuple (file,line,category,verdict,summary,failure_scenario), keeps lowest candidateId and duplicate evidence/IDs, orders by survivor total order, and hides refuted details unless the initial invocation explicitly requests them. If disclosure was explicitly requested, append a compact refuted-candidate section after ordinary findings, never mix it into findings.
Evaluate:
E1 empty requested diff;
E2 Finder returns zero candidates;
E3 Sweep returns zero candidates;
E4 deliberate zero-candidate Verifier returns verdicts:[];
E5 non-empty group receives verdicts:[] twice;
E6 no surviving candidates after all verified records are REFUTED;
E7 verified survivors exist, optional Synthesis fails;
E8 same but Synthesis returns no usable decisions;
E9 run the same verified/refuted fixture twice: ordinary invocation has survivor candidateId 1 CONFIRMED at src/live.ts:3 and refuted candidateId 2 REFUTED at src/bad.ts:4; explicit disclosure invocation requests refuted details.
For E7/E8 return reportPath, retryDecision, label, selected IDs. For E9 return reportShape, findings placement, refuted placement, and selected IDs for both disclosure modes. Return exactly {"role":"Fallback + empty/disclosure","cases":[...]}

